{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-20","kind":"proposition","title":"素数有无穷多个","englishTitle":"Prime numbers are more than any assigned multitude of prime numbers.","book":9,"number":20,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.20","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.20/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":20,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","contentId":"euclid-9-20","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a841c52157c0bd9ab6d32a82a9c1b3897dc92a133b2b5b455089683e682626e9","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-20.statement","euclid-9-20.construction.1","euclid-9-20.construction.2","euclid-9-20.proof.1","euclid-9-20.proof.2","euclid-9-20.proof.3","euclid-9-20.construction.3","euclid-9-20.proof.4","euclid-9-20.proof.5","euclid-9-20.proof.6","euclid-9-20.proof.7","euclid-9-20.proof.8","euclid-9-20.proof.9","euclid-9-20.proof.10","euclid-9-20.conclusion","euclid-9-20.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-20.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07667ba41fe2d9c23895fef39763bf1637eeb222a23ab100f9ad92447bcccad8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Prime numbers are more than any assigned multitude of prime numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"素数的个数多于任意给定的有限个数，因此素数有无穷多个。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e96b96187807d0a6b73407601a617ed03725bbf87961e2455e17a13a553e03b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B, C be the assigned prime numbers; I say that there are more prime numbers than A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B,C分配素数;我说,有素数多于A,B,C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf1ae6982b2eeebc2183da2f0c52ff094427a03f3186c4f562b492b2af48efbe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the least number measured by A, B, C be taken, and let it be DE; let the unit DF be added to DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以A、B、C为最低数值,以DE为最低数值;将单位、DF加到DE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"45c3d784c7d597ff9217f2d070afa3d37d884204045ef370e28e402f86b3a48b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then EF is either prime or not."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"那么EF要么是质数要么不是质数"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b3a3ee4e34c37e9ce28d9ffbbad7da3b85ea4006622c78fad71eb5a2b66b3458","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let it be prime; then the prime numbers A, B, C, EF have been found which are more than A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让它成为最优秀的;然后发现素数 A,B,C,EF,A以上。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6391f59e26d092711a0beea8d17e2b084fdec743c7faaee7f9d93f5f5c403387","citations":["euclid-7-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let EF not be prime; therefore it is measured by some prime number. [[VII. 31](/principles/euclid-7-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,EF不是最优秀的,因此,用大约素数整除。 [[VII. 31](/principles/euclid-7-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"168ec09f3f6470ae8c1fa38f83a53a1101a3edf2639628c2a5d04b2476f8182b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be measured by the prime number G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它用素数、G来整除（相关点与线段：G）"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f35924de156af03db63cfbd242b5cc7df021438f1ca9cdaa1ab8be6280b137fe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that G is not the same with any of the numbers A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,G与A、B、C的数字不一样。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9cd9fa71c430da369ed027085a7ed1390c168e9ba854439edeb085ea60b3eb53","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it be so."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"可能的话,就让它这样吧"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2f7104fcb57a7d86bdd482f1daf78ee356b05f533452b585a32ba493fa127d0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now A, B, C measure DE; therefore G also will measure DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在A,B,C,整除,DE;因此,G也将整除,DE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6948847569b5a0d3d552b79badaff65dbc87c039ebe004794a8b21a55508255","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也是整除 EF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d0b83619d949b7161f1cc093178ad1861ce7932b6581cfb5065aa04a4822bbcb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore G, being a number, will measure the remainder, the unit DF: which is absurd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,G,即整除, 剩下的单位DF,太荒谬了。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88cd9a787bb30556749464439580feda7865f7acd1dbdac75b10734fd9ea49b1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore G is not the same with any one of the numbers A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,G与A、B、C和A中任何一个人不同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"427579492247c072b507788d35bd8f300fa453455bdfceac508e70412abd38ec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And by hypothesis it is prime."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设这是最关键的"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":14,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bfbf56076eddc10fc1834017c370fa6fc322f5b76e8f5355bcbd20cc642c679a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the prime numbers A, B, C, G have been found which are more than the assigned multitude of A, B, C. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,发现了素数 A,B,C,G,超过了分配的A,B,C。证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-20.source","contentId":"euclid-9-20","revisionId":"euclid-9-20@raw-a841c52157c0bd9a","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f175223fee09e66ce4466798b8f1b94c578cec199f5d3dc1fdc971680bab119","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.20/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.20\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-20:euclid-7-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-20.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.20","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.20/","sourceLabel":"VII. 31"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-20:euclid-7-31:explicit","id":"euclid-7-31","book":7,"number":31,"kind":"proposition","title":"合数一定有素因子","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"proposition_specific","rendererId":"euclid-9-20","rationale":"The current renderer has proposition-specific code, but no human verification record exists."},"sourceIssues":[]}
